"<i>Species: Atlas.</i> “Ursa may hold the upper paw, but do not underestimate the thunderous might of Brutum. Beware, for crossing their paths means daring to challenge their dominion, even at the cost of their cherished treasure.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：Atlas。</i>「Ursaが優位に立つかもしれないが、Brutumの轟く力を侮るな。用心せよ、彼らの道を横切ることはその支配に挑むこと、たとえ大切な宝を失おうとも。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Pomponius Mela、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
"<i>Species: Barbary Lion.</i> “Transported clandestinely across the treacherous Mediterranean during the frigid grip of last winter’s mare clausum, these untamed exotic beasts ignite a frenzy of excitement within the crowd as they unleash their primal fury, tearing limbs asunder and delivering savage face-maulings.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：Barbary Lion。</i>「昨冬のmare clausumの凍てつく最中、危険な地中海をひそかに運ばれたこの野生の異国の獣たちは、原初の怒りを解き放って手足を引き裂き、獰猛に顔を噛み砕き、観衆を熱狂の渦に巻き込む。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Pomponius Mela、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
"<i>Species: Canis lupus.</i> “Valencia and Moechus, masters of the hunt, possess an insatiable appetite within the arena, their natural prowess and docility allowing them to effortlessly track their prey.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：Canis lupus。</i>「狩りの達人ValenciaとMoechusはアリーナで飽くなき食欲を持ち、天性の腕前と従順さで獲物を難なく追う。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Cassius Dio、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
"<i>Species: Human.</i> “Master of deception and self-proclaimed Champion Victorious, Commodus, a consummate fabricator, forges a path devoid of allies, shamelessly usurping the title within the realms of Flavius Rule.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：人間。</i>「欺瞞の達人にして自称Champion Victorious、稀代のでっち上げ屋Commodusは、味方を持たぬ道を切り開き、Flavius Ruleの領域で恥知らずにもその称号を簒奪する。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Cassius Dio、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
"<i>Species: Nāgá.</i> “Cherished companions of Flavius, these serpents become formidable contenders, embodying the essence of Asclepius, ensuring a ceaseless crimson cascade upon the arena sands.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：Nāgá。</i>「Flaviusに愛されるこの蛇たちは、Asclepiusの本質を体現する手強い競技者となり、アリーナの砂に絶え間ない深紅の滝を注ぐ。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Virgilante、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
"<i>Species: unknown.</i> “With its otherworldly visage and unparalleled brutality, Tholo stands as a living testament to the extraordinary and the unfathomable, seizing the gaze of spectators from across the empire, instilling fear that resonates within their souls.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>":"<i>種：不明。</i>「この世ならぬ顔つきと比類なき残忍さで、Tholoは並外れたもの、計り知れぬものの生きた証として立ち、帝国中の観客の視線を奪い、魂に響く恐怖を植えつける。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Virgilante、ludusの覚え書き</span>",
