"A Puteolan shipowner who made his fortune in the harbour and spends it on the sand. Waddles when he walks, and nobody laughs twice.":"港で財を成し、それを砂場に注ぎ込む Puteoli の船主。よちよち歩くが、二度笑う者はいない。",
