"I can still stand. I think.":"まだ立てる。たぶん。",
"I did not come to the sand to lose in front of empty seats.":"空席の前で負けるために砂場に来たんじゃない。",
"I did not pay for friendship.":"友情に金を払ったのではない。",
"I did say so.":"言ったでしょう。",
"I extend profound gratitude to my esteemed <i>Flavius</i> community, the valiant fr-qa-team, the venerable Indie Game Lab, and the illustrious board game design communities for their invaluable contributions, their sagacious counsel, and the endless wellspring of provided inspiration.\n  Furthermore, I humbly express boundless love and reverence to my father, who lent his guiding hand in designing and constructing the very first prototype of <i>Flavius Rule</i>, forever etching his legacy into this immersive realm.":"敬愛する<i>Flavius</i>のコミュニティ、勇敢なる fr-qa-team、尊き Indie Game Lab、そして名高きボードゲームデザインのコミュニティに、その計り知れない貢献と賢明な助言、尽きることのないひらめきの泉に深く感謝します。\n  さらに、<i>Flavius Rule</i>の最初の試作品の設計と製作に導きの手を貸し、この没入の世界に永遠にその足跡を刻んだ父に、限りない愛と敬意を謙虚に捧げます。",
"I fight at the":"俺の出番は",
"I foresaw the ending.":"結末は見えていた。",
"I fought here once. Good crowd, bad sand.":"昔ここで戦った。観衆は良かったが、砂は悪かった。",
"I have no complaints. Today.":"不満はない。今日のところは。",
"I have seen livelier mules.":"もっと元気なラバを見たことがある。",
"I have seen more passion at a tax hearing.":"税の審問の方がまだ情熱があったわ。",
"I have stood night watches with more excitement.":"夜警の方がまだ刺激があった。",
"I have watched paint dry with more nerve.":"ペンキが乾くのを見ている方がまだ緊張感がある。",
"I like your style, {n}.":"いい戦いぶりだな、{n}。",
"I need that":"あれが要る",
"I paid for this?":"これに金を払ったのか？",
"I read it in the smoke.":"煙の中に読んだ。",
"I shall weep at dinner.":"夕食の席で泣きますわ。",
"I shall write a satire!":"風刺詩を書こう！",
"I shall write your elegy.":"あなたの哀歌を書こう。",
"I sit. I watch. I sit again.":"座って、見て、また座る。",
