"Race counter-clockwise: north up the right side, west along the top, south down the left, east along the bottom across the red finish line. Lap {0}/3. Pillar gates at the top and bottom middle flip your horse, draw an offering and give a free step.{1}":"反時計回りに走る：右側を北へ、上辺を西へ、左側を南へ、下辺を東へ赤いゴールラインを越える。{0}/3周。上下中央の柱の門で馬が反転し、奉納品を引き、1歩無料で進める。{1}",
