"The governor of <b>{0}</b> orders that those who will not sacrifice to the gods be brought before him. {1} of our house {2} named.":"<b>{0}</b>の総督は、神々に犠牲を捧げぬ者を前に連れてくるよう命じた。当家の{1}{2||}が名指しされた。",
