"The guest pass is for thin purses — under {0} coin.":"招待券は懐の寂しい者のため — {0}コイン未満。",
"The guest pass is for thin treasuries — under {0} coin.":"ゲストパスは乏しい金庫のためのものです — {0}コイン未満。",
"The guide re-run, with wins by perk":"ガイドを再計算、パーク別勝利数つき",
"The hammer has fallen on that lot.":"その出品にはもう槌が下りました。",
"The hand-built board game that Flavius Rule Arena was distilled from — by D.Soto.":"Flavius Rule Arena の元になった手作りのボードゲーム — D.Soto 作。",
"The handlers drive {0} and {1} into the centre of the shrinking sand. {2} arrives winded from the wolf.":"係員が{0}と{1}を縮む砂場の中央へ追い立てる。{2}は狼との戦いで息を切らしてやって来る。",
"The hardest to kill: most bouts walked away from this season.":"最もしぶとい者：今シーズン最も多くの試合から生還した。",
"The harvest came in early; the wine flows":"収穫が早く、ワインがあふれる",
"The heart of it: <b>⚔️ Match Week</b>.":"中心となるのは:<b>⚔️ 試合週</b>。",
"The heats":"予選",
"The heavens roar!":"天が轟く！",
"The highest rank":"最高の階級",
