"The system cohorts":"システムのコホート",
"The system invitationals":"システムの invitational",
"The table and the week (v0.29)":"順位表と1週間（v0.29）",
"The tame bond between {0} and {1} is severed.":"{0}と{1}の手なずけの絆が断たれる。",
"The team":"チーム",
"The thumb goes down ({0}); the d12 names {1}. You may still pay the editor {2} coin.":"親指は下を向く（{0}）。d12は{1}を告げる。まだ主催者に{2}コインを払える。",
"The thumb goes down ({0}); the d12 names {1}. You may still pay the editor {2}.":"親指は下を向いた（{0}）。d12 は{1}を告げる。まだ主催者に{2}を払えます。",
