"⚕ <b>The infirmary</b> — steam, salves, and men who charge by the scream. <b>Every cure is paid from your treasury.</b> The Medicus, the surgeon and Hygeia's priests also count toward your physicians' <b>weekly cap</b> — they can do at most <b>{0}</b> coin of treasury a week (<b>{1}</b> left this week); the bathhouse and the temple of Asclepius are outside help and do not count. <b>Care must match the wound</b>: rest heals bruises, the Medicus mends muscle, only the <b>surgeon's knife</b> stops a festering wound, and only <b>Hygeia</b> regrows a lost limb. Ignore a festering wound for three weeks and your fighter dies, flees, or is never quite whole again.":"⚕ <b>医務室</b> — 湯気、軟膏、そして悲鳴の数で料金を取る男たち。<b>治療費はすべて金庫から支払われます。</b>Medicus、外科医、Hygeia の神官は医師の<b>週の上限</b>に数えられます — 金庫から週に最大<b>{0}</b>コイン（今週の残り<b>{1}</b>）。浴場と Asclepius の神殿は外部の助けで、数えません。<b>治療は傷に合わせること</b>：休養は打撲を治し、Medicus は筋肉を治し、<b>外科医のメス</b>だけが化膿した傷を止め、<b>Hygeia</b>だけが失った手足を再生します。化膿した傷を3週放置すると、闘士は死ぬか、逃げるか、二度と元に戻りません。",
"⚕ <b>The infirmary</b> — steam, salves, and men who charge by the scream. <b>Every cure is paid from your treasury.</b> The Medicus, the surgeon and Hygeia's priests also count toward your physicians' <b>weekly cap</b> — they can do at most <b>{0}</b> of treasury a week (<b>{1}</b> left this week); the bathhouse and the temple of Asclepius are outside help and do not count. <b>Care must match the wound</b>: rest heals bruises, the Medicus mends muscle, only the <b>surgeon's knife</b> stops a festering wound, and only <b>Hygeia</b> regrows a lost limb. Ignore a festering wound for three weeks and your fighter dies, flees, or is never quite whole again.":"⚕ <b>医務室</b> — 湯気、軟膏、そして悲鳴の数で料金を取る男たち。<b>治療費はすべて金庫から支払われます。</b>Medicus、外科医、Hygeia の神官は医師の<b>週の上限</b>に数えられます — 金庫から週に最大<b>{0}</b>（今週の残り<b>{1}</b>）。浴場と Asclepius の神殿は外部の助けで、数えません。<b>治療は傷に合わせること</b>：休養は打撲を治し、Medicus は筋肉を治し、<b>外科医のメス</b>だけが化膿した傷を止め、<b>Hygeia</b>だけが失った手足を再生します。化膿した傷を3週放置すると、闘士は死ぬか、逃げるか、二度と元に戻りません。",
