"🎟 <b>Play as a spectator</b> (all seats CPU): earn CF each rotation, throw stones or offerings, change sections and chant for Tholo":"🎟 <b>観客としてプレイ</b>(全席 CPU):巡ごとに CF を得て、石や奉納品を投げ、区画を移り、Tholo を呼ぶ詠唱をする",
"🎟 <b>Spectating is back — everywhere.</b> In Play now, with every seat CPU, <b>Play as a spectator</b> seats you in the stands before the horns (the crowd is filled in if you had none). During any match with no fighter of yours standing — none entered, or yours has fallen — <b>🎟 Buy a ticket</b> seats you mid-bout, paid from the active wallet (general admission 4 coin, not counted as betting). Each rotation you earn 1 CF and may throw stones or offerings, change sections or join a chant for Tholo.":"🎟 <b>観戦が復活 — どこでも。</b>「すぐに遊ぶ」で全席 CPU にすると、<b>観客としてプレイ</b>で角笛の前に観客席に座れます(観衆がいなければ補充)。自分の闘士が立っていない試合中なら — 出場していないか倒れたなら — <b>🎟 チケットを買う</b>で試合中に座れます。使用中の財布から支払い(一般席4コイン、賭けには数えない)。巡ごとに1 CF を得て、石や奉納品を投げ、区画を移り、Tholo を呼ぶ詠唱に加われます。",
"🎟 <b>Spectating is back — everywhere.</b> In Play now, with every seat CPU, <b>Play as a spectator</b> seats you in the stands before the horns (the crowd is filled in if you had none). During any match with no fighter of yours standing — none entered, or yours has fallen — <b>🎟 Buy a ticket</b> seats you mid-bout, paid from the active wallet (general admission {0}, not counted as betting). Each rotation you earn {1} and may throw stones or offerings, change sections or join a chant for Tholo.":"🎟 <b>観戦が復活 — どこでも。</b>すぐに遊ぶで全席 CPU のとき、<b>観客として遊ぶ</b>で角笛の前に観客席に座れます（観衆がいなければ補充）。あなたの闘士が立っていない試合 — 出場していないか倒れた — では、<b>🎟 チケットを買う</b>で試合途中から着席、使用中の財布から支払い（一般席{0}、賭けには数えない）。毎巡{1}を得て、石や奉納品を投げ、区画を変え、Tholo への詠唱に加われます。",
