"🦅 <b>The show goes on.</b> On the main menu, after the Damnatio is hauled off, the base beasts come for the rest: the eagle drops from above, the bear rises from behind, wolves and snakes come in from the front, and Tholo reaches out of the shadows. With the sand empty, <b>Commodus</b> strides in and raises his sword as laurels and flowers rain at his feet — and now and then a gladiator comes back, fights him in a cloud of dust, and kneels over his body.":"🦅 <b>ショーは続く。</b>メインメニューで Damnatio が運び出された後、残りの基本の猛獣がやって来ます:鷲が上から舞い降り、熊が背後から立ち上がり、狼と蛇が前から入り、Tholo が影から手を伸ばす。砂場が空になると<b>Commodus</b>が堂々と入場し、月桂冠と花が足元に降る中で剣を掲げます — そして時々、剣闘士が戻ってきて砂煙の中で彼と戦い、その亡骸の上にひざまずきます。",
